0059:     - One non-background color forms a complete one-cell-thick bar on exactly one outer edge.
0060:     - The other foreground color appears only in the first two cells inward from that bar, lane by lane.
0061: 
0062:     Rule
0063:     - In each lane perpendicular to the edge bar, a one-pixel marker adjacent to the bar grows one more cell inward.
0064:     - A two-pixel marker in those first two inward cells is cleared back to background.
0065:     - The cleared two-pixel marker is replaced by a two-pixel mark of the edge-bar color at the opposite side of the same lane.
0066: 
